{"id":"nbdf8e0961ab2","url":"https://www.english.ids-cologne.de/for-exhibitors/plan-trade-fair-presence-on-site/advertising-options-analogue-digital/","title":"Advertising options analogue & digital","source":"IDS Cologne","date":"2027-03-20T12:00:00.000Z","byline":"","image":"https://media.koelnmesse.io/ids/redaktionell/ids/img/teaser/flaggen.jpg","html":"<p>Our advertising options offer you the opportunity to draw the attention of interested parties, visitors and multipliers to you prior to, during and after the trade fair.</p> <h2> Our offer </h2> <a href=\"https://www.english.ids-cologne.de/for-exhibitors/plan-trade-fair-presence-on-site/advertising-options-analogue-digital/advertising-spaces/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://media.koelnmesse.io/ids/redaktionell/global/img/website-structure/for-exhibitors/plan-trade-fair-presence/advertising_spaces/indoor_outdoor_-advertising_-spaces_1200x675_m28_1025.jpg\" alt=\"Advertising spaces\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n</a>\n\n<h3> Advertising space </h3>\n<p>Book attractive advertising space or plan individual advertising campaigns together with us - for visibility on the floor and around the exhibition center. </p>\n <a href=\"https://www.english.ids-cologne.de/for-exhibitors/plan-trade-fair-presence-on-site/advertising-options-analogue-digital/advertising-spaces/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Find out about advertising space now </a> <a href=\"https://nfm-mediashop.de/2027/ids/en/?tab=showroom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://media.koelnmesse.io/ids/redaktionell/global/img/website-structure/for-exhibitors/plan-trade-fair-presence/online__und_printmedien_m28_1025.jpg\" alt=\"Online and print media at IDS\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n</a>\n\n<h3> Online and print media </h3>\n<p>Optimise your trade fair appearance and raise your visibility in the official fair media. </p>\n<a href=\"https://nfm-mediashop.de/2027/ids/en/?tab=showroom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> To the Media Shop </a> <a href=\"https://www.english.ids-cologne.de/for-exhibitors/plan-trade-fair-presence-on-site/advertising-options-analogue-digital/press-compartments-for-exhibitors/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://media.koelnmesse.io/ids/redaktionell/global/img/website-structure/press/multimedia/social_media_newsletter_1200x675_m28_1025.jpg\" alt=\"Online press compartments at IDS\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n</a>\n\n<h3> Online press compartments for exhibitors </h3>\n<p>Inform the trade press easily and conveniently with the online press compartments.</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.english.ids-cologne.de/for-exhibitors/plan-trade-fair-presence-on-site/advertising-options-analogue-digital/press-compartments-for-exhibitors/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Book press compartments </a> <a href=\"https://www.english.ids-cologne.de/for-exhibitors/order-services/visitor-tickets/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://media.koelnmesse.io/ids/redaktionell/global/img/website-structure/for-exhibitors/visitor-management/admission_ticket_voucher_1200x675_2_m28_1025.jpg\" alt=\"Order ticket codes for IDS\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n</a>\n\n<h3> Ticket codes </h3>\n<p>Make sure that your customers come to you - with our free ticket codes for your visitors.</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.english.ids-cologne.de/for-exhibitors/order-services/visitor-tickets/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Order ticket codes </a> <a href=\"https://www.english.ids-cologne.de/for-exhibitors/plan-trade-fair-presence-on-site/advertising-options-analogue-digital/pr-service-for-exhibitors/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://media.koelnmesse.io/ids/redaktionell/global/img/website-structure/press/participation-for-media-representatives/pressekonferenz_m28_1025.jpg\" alt=\"PR service for IDS exhibitors\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n</a>\n\n<h3> PR service for exhibitors </h3>\n<p>For services during the event</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.english.ids-cologne.de/for-exhibitors/plan-trade-fair-presence-on-site/advertising-options-analogue-digital/pr-service-for-exhibitors/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Service and information </a> <a href=\"https://www.english.ids-cologne.de/for-exhibitors/order-services/catering/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://media.koelnmesse.io/ids/redaktionell/global/img/website-structure/for-exhibitors/plan-trade-fair-presence/catering/gastronomie_und_events_m28_1025.jpg\" alt=\"Food and service concepts at IDS\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n</a>\n\n<h3> Food Service and Events </h3>\n<p>For culinary needs</p>","kind":"full"}